    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d2b07cf1-b34e-5712-8a74-2e8861240030" activityNameId="0d737461-c8e3-5138-bc7f-0e93fbecd37d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, low voltage, production IL, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, low voltage, production IL, at grid
Electricity domestic net production shares are based on annual averages for 2023. Losses are distributed across voltage levels with total losses for the same time frame as well as older proxy data for disaggregation. Electricity trade between countries is not included so the consumption reflects the mix of domestic production and domestic losses. The distribution network and direct emissions to air (SF6-emissions) are also included. Remark: This dataset describes the distribution of low voltage electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air-, vacuum- and SF6-insulated medium-to-low voltage switching stations. Assumptions for distribution network, losses and emissions are based on older UCTE data. UUID: 53ad81e5-0432-3983-8d28-a68b75b5b7d1
Included are the shares of domestic electricity production by technology at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to utilities and auto-producers.
Technology: No technology description is provided because the dataset just describes the power plant portfolio of the respective country using current average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time period of statistics used.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Statistical data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_53ad81e5-0432-3983-8d28-a68b75b5b7d1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
